px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: center;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-nanumbarungothic   " id="SE-ce8da368-d435-11f1-aa05-f9bdca18a6ac" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumbarungothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔바른고딕&quot;, nanumbarungothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;">현장 태블릿 접수는 </span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center " id="SE-f6756f6b-d41c-11f1-aa05-a9008649343d" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: center;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-nanumbarungothic   " id="SE-ce8da369-d435-11f1-aa05-577546960bbe" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumbarungothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔바른고딕&quot;, nanumbarungothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;">오전 9시 30분부터 안내됐어요.</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center " id="SE-bf48aebc-0b3f-4c4c-9ff2-7a41f78a3f6a" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: break-spaces; text-align: center;"><span class="se-fs- se-ff-nanumbarungothic   " id="SE-ce8da36a-d435-11f1-aa05-d5de0cc13fb5" style="box-sizing: unset; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; font-family: se-nanumbarungothic, arial, &quot;\\B098눔바른고딕&quot;, nanumbarungothic, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;">등록 후에는</span></p><p class="se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center " id="SE-f7f7c9d1-d41c-11f1-aa05-155e32aa0ab5" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: unset; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-var